From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] avutil/hwcontext_v4l2request: define NV15 and NV20 where the
 headers lack them

Debian's kernel headers predate V4L2_PIX_FMT_NV15, so the capture format
table compiled without it, and a 10-bit stream on rkvdec, which offers
only NV15, found no format it knew and fell back to software.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c b/libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c
--- a/libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c
+++ b/libavutil/hwcontext_v4l2request.c
@@ -37,6 +37,14 @@
 #include "mathematics.h"
 #include "mem.h"
 
+// rkvdec's 10-bit formats, where the kernel's headers predate them.
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_NV15
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_NV15 v4l2_fourcc('N', 'V', '1', '5')
+#endif
+#ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_NV20
+#define V4L2_PIX_FMT_NV20 v4l2_fourcc('N', 'V', '2', '0')
+#endif
+
 // Cedrus's AFBC formats, where the kernel's headers predate them.
 #ifndef V4L2_PIX_FMT_YUV420_8_AFBC_16X16_SPLIT
 #define V4L2_PIX_FMT_YUV420_8_AFBC_16X16_SPLIT v4l2_fourcc('A', 'S', '1', '2')
